WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Twelve minutes can sound like a promise that's easy to keep.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
But a routine and a scientific result are not the same thing.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
A study of sound or suggestion does not automatically test a product.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
First ask what the recording includes. Then ask what the evidence supports.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Try twelve minutes without buying anything. Notice what happens.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Read the sources. Choose your next step. Final Vestige.
